{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
    "name": "Study Room API",
    "description": "study-room Spring Boot API (local dev)\n\n## Variables\n- `baseUrl`: http://localhost:8080\n- `accessToken` / `refreshToken`: set by **Login — success**\n- `testEmail` / `testPassword`: default test user\n- `roomId`: seed room (usually 1)\n- `idempotencyKey`: UUID for reservation create (change for a new booking)\n\n## Auth\n- Public: `/actuator/health`, `/api/v1/rooms/**`, `/api/v1/auth/**`\n- JWT required: `/api/v1/me`, `/api/v1/reservations`, `/actuator/info`\n\n## Reservation policy (application.properties)\n- Duration 30m–4h, 30-minute multiples\n- Max 30 days ahead, max 3 active (CONFIRMED) per user\n\n## Suggested flow\n1. Signup (or existing user) → **Login — success**\n2. **List rooms** if you need a roomId\n3. **Create reservation — success** (201)\n4. **Create reservation — same key** (200, idempotent replay)\n5. **Create reservation — overlap** (409 RESERVATION_TIME_CONFLICT)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
